OL,3,GNEWSAWarrington is 'almost a city' says
OL,4,ABurnham - but is it?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham, who grew
OL,7,Fup in a village near Warrington,
OL,8,Frecently described the Cheshire town as
OL,9,Fbeing "almost a city".
OL,11,FIn response to a question from one of
OL,12,Fthe town's two MPs, he said Warrington
OL,13,Fwas "something of a jewel in the North
OL,14,FWest crown".
OL,16,FWith a population higher than some of
OL,17,Fthe region's cities, could Warrington
OL,18,Fbe granted that status one day? What
OL,19,Fwould it mean and does it really
OL,20,Fmatter?
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
